    {
      "@id": "concept:national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023-sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 After subsection 187(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023#sch-1-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) Without limiting subsection (1), the legislative instrument may\nmake requirements that depend on the making of a decision of an\nadministrative character by the National VET Regulator.\n\n(1B) To avoid doubt, the reference to person in paragraph (1)(b)\nincludes a person from time to time holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of a specified office or position, even if the\noffice or position does not come into existence until after the\nMinisterial Council’s agreement is given.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nNational Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data\nStreamlining) Amendment Act 2023\nNo. 49, 2023",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) Without limiting subsection (1), the legislative instrument may\nmake requirements that depend on the making of a decision of an\nadministrative character by the National VET Regulator.\n\n(1B) To avoid doubt, the reference to person in paragraph (1)(b)\nincludes a person from time to time holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of a specified office or position, even if the\noffice or position does not come into existence until after the\nMinisterial Council’s agreement is given.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nNational Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data\nStreamlining) Amendment Act 2023\nNo. 49, 2023",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023-sch-1-sec-3-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023-sch-1-sec-3-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023#sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 After subsection 187(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) Without limiting subsection (1), the legislative instrument may\nmake requirements that depend on the making of a decision of an\nadministrative character by the National VET Regulator.\n\n(1B) To avoid doubt, the reference to person in paragraph (1)(b)\nincludes a person from time to time holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of a specified office or position, even if the\noffice or position does not come into existence until after the\nMinisterial Council’s agreement is given.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nNational Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data\nStreamlining) Amendment Act 2023\nNo. 49, 2023"
    },
